  I don't actually use "You're welcome" and "You are welcome"
interchangeably, despite the fact that one is, logically speaking, only a
contraction of the other.  I would never use the latter as a response to
"Thank you" Nonetheless, I do agree  that the proposed changes are
appropriate, and should be made.

  (But this really belongs on the jbovlaste gorup, not the main)

          --gejyspa



